# Pull new mail from Fastmail's INBOX into Dovecot's. mbsync is an
# IMAP client of each, so it never opens the maildir.
#
# Only new messages move, and only from Fastmail to here: nothing is
# sent back, and nothing is removed from lab-mail. A message deleted
# or moved on Fastmail stays here.

IMAPAccount fastmail
Host imap.fastmail.com
Port 993
TLSType IMAPS
UserCmd "sed -n 1p /data/secrets/mail-creds"
PassCmd "sed -n 2p /data/secrets/mail-creds"

IMAPStore fastmail
Account fastmail

# Dovecot on loopback, with no TLS. mbsync sends a password in the
# clear only over a mechanism named here.
IMAPAccount lab-mail
Host 127.0.0.1
Port 2143
TLSType None
AuthMechs LOGIN
User mbsync
PassCmd "cat /data/secrets/mbsync-imap"

IMAPStore lab-mail
Account lab-mail

Channel list
Far :fastmail:INBOX
Near :lab-mail:INBOX
Sync Pull New
Create None
Expunge None
Remove None
CopyArrivalDate yes
SyncState /data/mail/mbsync/
